{
  "about": "Research-stage evaluation set. Each case is an idea plus the components a good answer MUST surface (each group is satisfied by any one of its aliases, matched case-insensitively against a component's name or source) and ones that must NOT appear. The aliases are well-known, long-lived projects in each field, chosen so that missing all of them means the research missed the field's standard tools. Cases marked set=tuned were used while improving the agents; cases marked set=holdout were added afterwards, from unrelated fields, and no prompt was ever tuned on them, so their score shows how well the system generalises.",
